      "value": "@{5b75bede93319c236961012f|full_name}: In order to improve the quality of communication between developers and gamers it was created this site where everybody can add a suggestion and vote it. Don’t forget the VRChat is in early access and developers constantly investigate various game aspects. So the Roadmap is constantly changing and there is no sense to publish it. Add suggestions, vote suggestions and send bug reports on this site. It’s the best way for users to improve the game.",
